id: DRAFT-shairplay-dlopen-dnssd-header-gate
draft: true
trigger_tool: 'configure|clang|make'
phase: configuration
error_signature: 'Could not find dns_sd.h header, please install libavahi-compat-libdnssd-dev or equivalent'
severity: 2
category: 'optional-dependency, autotools, runtime-dlopen, ohos'
match_keywords: 'dns_sd.h, dlopen, HAVE_LIBDL, libdns_sd.so, Bonjour, Avahi, optional runtime, Autotools'
title: 'Optional DNS-SD runtime incorrectly becomes a build-time header requirement'
root_cause: >-
  A configure.ac branch checks dns_sd.h when Libtool has found dlopen. In this
  branch the library source declares the small DNS-SD ABI locally and loads
  libdns_sd.so dynamically; the header is only needed when that dynamic path
  is unavailable. The test polarity is reversed, turning an optional runtime
  service into a false build-time dependency on HarmonyOS PC.
affected_scope: >-
  Older C/Autotools libraries that use dlopen with local opaque API declarations
  and optional Bonjour/Avahi compatibility services. Apply only after checking
  that the dynamic branch actually defines all needed types and symbols.
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: 'match-configure-header-gate-to-compiled-branch'
rec_description: >-
  Verify the dlopen probe and the C preprocessor branch, then require dns_sd.h
  only when neither direct nor libdl dlopen support is available. Preserve the
  actual dynamic loader and its explicit LIBNOTFOUND/PROCNOTFOUND errors.
  Validate by building and linking an installed-package consumer that calls
  dnssd_init on the target, including the absent-runtime path.
rec_command: 'if test yes != "$libltdl_cv_func_dlopen" && test yes != "$libltdl_cv_lib_dl_dlopen"; then AC_CHECK_HEADERS([dns_sd.h], [], [AC_MSG_ERROR([missing dns_sd.h])]); fi'
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: 'patch-configure-ac-and-regenerate-configure'
forbid_1_pattern: 'stub DNSServiceRegister|return 0 without calling dnssd_init'
forbid_1_reason: 'Such a stub conceals the optional-runtime boundary and does not prove the packaged library works.'
source_event: 'shairplay 0.9.0-git20180824.096b61a on HarmonyOS PC; target conan create and installed-package consumer W3_PASS on 2026-09-29'
dedup_note: >-
  Existing E160 and DRAFT-E656 document config.guess/HongMeng and Autotools
  timestamp failures. They do not cover the reversed DNS-SD header gate or
  the dlopen-vs-compile-time API boundary documented here.
